ings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"We'll be raising price.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"Accordingly, we are repositioning to streamline the business while investing for more profitable growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Naemura","x":"We recognized a restructuring charge of $4 million in Q1, which is part of the approximately $20 million charge that we continue to anticipate for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"Where we're getting a really good backlog there, and we've raised the outlook for full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2021-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"So I think that the combination of both those really give us more confidence to raise our outlook in full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/10/vontier-corporation-vnt-q1-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Trish Gorman","x":"And then just the cadence of from when you announced the price increase, typically, how long does that take for it to become effective?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/vontier-corporation-vnt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"So we had a number of price increases this year that were not sort of in schedule -- within schedule is a pricing increase for the end of the year that sets you up for the beginning of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/vontier-corporation-vnt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Naemura","x":"We recognized a restructuring charge of approximately $3 million in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/vontier-corporation-vnt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2021-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Dave Naemura","x":"That said, we are raising our outlook for adjusted earnings per share to a range of $2.82 to $2.86, growth of approximately 14% to 16% year over year, reflecting continued momentum and execution in our core business, combined with about $0.04 to $0.05 contribution for the in-year impact of the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/vontier-corporation-vnt-q3-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q4","e":"vnt","d":"2022-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"We have strong, steady demand pricing power, and a track record of successfully navigating unprecedented headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/vontier-corporation-vnt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q4","e":"vnt","d":"2022-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Obin","x":"…decent structure, if you look at electric [Inaudible] is doing in the channel, if you look at the scope of price increases that HVAC industry is able to achieve, given a favorable industry structure in North America, how do you think about potentially pushing the pricing further in the EMV space?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/vontier-corporation-vnt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q4","e":"vnt","d":"2022-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mark Morelli","x":"Harnessing VBS to reduce emissions, drive cost savings, and develop and engage our employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/vontier-corporation-vnt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2021 Q4","e":"vnt","d":"2022-02-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dave Naemura","x":"During the fourth quarter, we recognized restructuring charges of approximately $4 million, slightly lower than we previously planned, as the timing of certain actions have now shifted into 2022.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/18/vontier-corporation-vnt-q4-2021-earnings-call-tran/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Ridley-Lane","x":"And I'm surprised I'm going to be the first person asked this, but the changes to Section 232 tariffs, IEEPA tariffs, can you just give us around the world on what the impact of Vontier is going to be inside 2026 as you see it?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/vontier-vnt-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"The tariff remains a very dynamic environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/vontier-vnt-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"At the same time, our cost-out activities are ramping in Q2, giving us momentum for the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/vontier-vnt-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q1","e":"vnt","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cu