er-vnt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q2","e":"vnt","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"We're increasing the guide from low to mid-single digits to mid-single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/vontier-vnt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q2","e":"vnt","d":"2026-08-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"There's really a little bit of a mix change where we've increased the guide on our environmental and fueling business to mid-single digits.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/vontier-vnt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Nigel Coe","x":"I got to ask the question, any tariff refunds?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/vontier-corp-vnt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"One, I talked about the $15 million cost-out program, which is trending or is at $20 million, so that is about a $2 million pickup per quarter versus what we had previously guided.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/vontier-corp-vnt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"Based on the progress we've made on self-help, we're raising our outlook for the full year operating margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/vontier-corp-vnt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"VNT 2026 Q3","e":"vnt","d":"2026-11-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Anshooman Aga","x":"Carrying through the outperformance in Q3 and increased outlook of Q4, we now expect adjusted EPS in the range of $3.60-$3.64, representing low double-digit growth versus the prior year and above the high 